                                 + (1/3)\,\bar{f}(X_2,1/2)
                                 + (4/9)\,\bar{f}(X_3,3/4) \\
                       & = & 1 + (2/9)(-1) + (1/3)(-1/2) + (4/9)(-5/8) \\
